    <string name="about_version">Manka %1$s</string>
    <string name="about_credits">Built on zapret and zapret2 (bol-van), ByeDPI (hufrea), tg-ws-proxy (Flowseal) and its Rust port (valnesfjord), the CDPI UI store (Storik4pro), dnsproxy (AdGuard). Inspired by ByeByeDPI.</string>

